{"_v":1,"id":"leap-of-faith-2012","cs":52,"rc":16,"bd":{"positive":1,"mixed":5,"negative":10},"rv":[{"cn":"Chris Jones","o":"Chicago Tribune","s":76,"b":"Positive","t":1,"u":"https://www.chicagotribune.com/entertainment/theater/theaterloop/sc-ent-0426-leap-faith-broadway-review-20120426-7,0,6392679.column","q":"There is some fun to be had — a little — but this also scrambles the rules and bifurcates the show."},{"cn":"Scott Brown","o":"Vulture","s":62,"b":"Mixed","t":1,"u":"https://www.vulture.com/2012/04/how-leap-of-faith-falls-short.html","q":"It’s just not quite enough to bring us to our feet."},{"cn":"Mark Kennedy","o":"Associated Press","s":58,"b":"Mixed","t":1,"u":"https://www.huffpost.com/huff-wires/20120426/us-theater-review-leap-of-faith/","d":"2012-04-26","q":"There's a strong musical somewhere in 'Leap of Faith,' which stars a soulful Raul Esparza and has some of Alan Menken's best songs."},{"cn":"David Rooney","o":"The Hollywood Reporter","s":52,"b":"Negative","t":1,"u":"https://www.hollywoodreporter.com/review/leap-faith-theater-review-317119","d":"2012-04-26","q":"But despite Raul Esparza's hard-working lead performance and some rousing gospel numbers from Alan Menken and Glenn Slater, the story remains stubbornly unappealing."},{"cn":"Marilyn Stasio","o":"Variety","s":44,"b":"Negative","t":1,"u":"https://variety.com/2012/film/reviews/while-we-were-here-1117947436/","d":"2012-04-26","q":"Despite the star power of Raul Esparza and a slick production, this musical about a con-man evangelist never finds its spiritual center or comic groove."},{"cn":"Linda Winer","o":"Newsday","s":42,"b":"Negative","t":1,"u":"https://www.newsday.com/entertainment/theater/leap-of-faith-requires-a-major-one-1.3682060","d":"2012-04-26","q":"But the show shouldn't feel that way, too."},{"cn":"Ben Brantley","o":"The New York Times","s":42,"b":"Negative","t":1,"u":"https://www.nytimes.com/2012/04/27/theater/reviews/leap-of-faith-at-st-james-theater.html","d":"2012-04-26","q":"The show feels as if it were assembled by a committee of focus groups."},{"cn":"Terry Teachout","o":"The Wall Street Journal","s":42,"b":"Negative","t":1,"u":"https://www.wsj.com/articles/SB10001424127887324712504578133131735089080","d":"2012-04-27","q":"The show is well-intentioned but fatally confused about what it wants to say."},{"cn":"David Cote","o":"Time Out New York","s":40,"b":"Negative","t":1,"u":"https://www.timeout.com/newyork/theater/leap-of-faith","d":"2012-04-26","q":"A show as bland and confused as Leap of Faith is not going to make rich men of its producers."},{"cn":"Thom Geier","o":"Entertainment Weekly","s":72,"b":"Positive","t":2,"u":"https://www.ew.com/ew/article/0,,20364394_20589865,00.html","q":"But there's a second-hand quality to the show that's hard to escape and not because it's based on a movie."},{"cn":"Elysa Gardner","o":"USA Today","s":72,"b":"Positive","t":2,"u":"https://www.usatoday.com/life/theater/reviews/story/2012-04-25/leap-of-faith-broadway-review/54570154/1?csp=34life&utm_source=feedburner&utm_medium=feed&utm_campaign=Feed%3A+usatoday-LifeTopStories+%28Life+-+Top+Stories%29","d":"2012-04-25","q":"Their contributions help lift Faith above its uneven aspects and become, if not a rapturous experience, a compelling curiosity."},{"cn":"Howard Shapiro","o":"The Philadelphia Inquirer","s":65,"b":"Mixed","t":2,"u":"https://articles.philly.com/2012-04-26/news/31410879_1_jonas-nightingale-revival-broadway-review","d":"2012-04-26","q":"If the show offers any real revelation, it's that the playwriting does, too."},{"cn":"Joe Dziemianowicz","o":"New York Daily News","s":44,"b":"Negative","t":2,"u":"https://www.nydailynews.com/entertainment/theater-review-leap-faith-article-1.1068009?localLinksEnabled=false","q":"Esparza’s not a miracle worker; he can’t save the show."},{"cn":"Robert Feldberg","o":"NorthJersey.com","s":44,"b":"Negative","t":2,"u":"https://www.northjersey.com/arts_entertainment/149189075_Who_is_he_fooling_A_charlatan_preacher_we_ve_all_seen_before.html","q":"Besides being a busy borrower, the derivative musical leans heavily on clichés."},{"cn":"Erik Haagensen","o":"Backstage","s":20,"b":"Pan","t":2,"u":"https://www.backstage.com/bso/reviews-ny-theatre-broadway/ny-review-leap-of-faith-1006895152.story","q":"You know you're in trouble at 'Leap of Faith' even before the show starts, when actors pretending to be revivalists distribute what are supposed to be dollar bills to the audience, so we will have something to put in the collection basket when it's passed."},{"cn":"Jonathan Mandell","o":"Faster Times","s":54,"b":"Negative","t":3,"u":"https://www.thefastertimes.com/newyorktheater/2012/04/26/leap-of-faith-review/","d":"2012-04-26","q":"It's an ersatz experience, emotionally and musically."}],"au":{"score":51,"designation":"Loathing","sources":{"mz":{"s":51,"c":11,"sr":2.5}}},"ta":"246 W 44th St, New York, NY 10036","pd":"2012-04-03","ca":[{"n":"Raúl Esparza","r":"Jonas Nightingale"},{"n":"Talon Ackerman","r":"Jake McGowan"},{"n":"Krystal Joy Brown","r":"Ornella Sturdevant"},{"n":"Kendra Kassebaum","r":"Sam Nightingale"},{"n":"Kecia Lewis-Evans","r":"Ida Mae Sturdevant"},{"n":"Leslie Odom, Jr.","r":"Isaiah Sturdevant"},{"n":"Jessica Phillips","r":"Marla McGowan"},{"n":"Hettie Vyrine Barnhill","r":"Angel of Mercy"},{"n":"Ta'Rea Campbell","r":"Angel of Mercy"},{"n":"Michelle Duffy","r":"Susie Raylove"},{"n":"Lynorris Evans","r":"Angel of Mercy"},{"n":"Dierdre Friel","r":"Amanda Wayne"},{"n":"Bob Gaynor","r":"Angel of Mercy"},{"n":"Lucia Giannetta","r":"Angel of Mercy"},{"n":"Angela Grovey","r":"Angel of Mercy"},{"n":"Louis Hobson","r":"Townsperson"},{"n":"Tiffany Janene Howard","r":"Angel of Mercy"},{"n":"Grasan Kingsberry","r":"Angel of Mercy"},{"n":"Fletcher McTaggart","r":"Angel of Mercy"},{"n":"Maurice Murphy","r":"Offstage Vocalist"},{"n":"Terita Redd","r":"Offstage Vocalist"},{"n":"Eliseo Román","r":"Angel of Mercy"},{"n":"Bryce Ryness","r":"Brother Zak"},{"n":"Ann Sanders","r":"Townsperson"},{"n":"C. E. Smith","r":"Brother Amon"},{"n":"Danny Stiles","r":"Townsperson"},{"n":"Dennis Stowe","r":"Brother Carl"},{"n":"Betsy Struxness","r":"Angel of Mercy"},{"n":"Roberta B. Wall","r":"Emma Schlarp"},{"n":"Virginia Ann Woodruff","r":"Angel of Mercy"}]}